(Northwind Traders Employee Handbook) Tj T*
(Section 1. Working hours) Tj T*
(Standard working hours are 9:00 to 17:30, Monday to Friday, with a paid lunch break of 45) Tj T*
(minutes. Employees who work in the warehouse follow the shift rota published each Thursday) Tj T*
(by the operations manager.) Tj T*
(Overtime must be approved in advance by a line manager. Approved overtime is paid at 1.5) Tj T*
(times the normal hourly rate on weekdays and at twice the normal rate on public holidays.) Tj T*
(Overtime that was not approved in advance is not paid.) Tj T*
(Section 2. Leave) Tj T*
(Full-time employees receive 25 days of annual leave per calendar year, plus public) Tj T*
(holidays. Part-time employees receive annual leave in proportion to their contracted) Tj T*
(hours. Up to 5 days of unused annual leave can be carried over into the next year and must) Tj T*
(be used before the end of March.) Tj T*
(Employees receive 10 days of paid sick leave per year. A doctor's note is required for any) Tj T*
(absence longer than 3 consecutive working days.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
