(Parental leave is 16 weeks at full pay for the primary caregiver and 4 weeks at full pay) Tj T*
(for the secondary caregiver. Parental leave must be requested at least 8 weeks before the) Tj T*
(expected start date.) Tj T*
(Bereavement leave of 5 days is available after the death of an immediate family member. Up) Tj T*
(to 2 further days may be granted for travel when the funeral is abroad.) Tj T*
(Section 3. Remote work) Tj T*
(Employees in eligible roles may work remotely for up to 2 days per week after completing) Tj T*
(their probation period of 6 months. Remote work requests are submitted through the HR) Tj T*
(portal and approved by the employee's line manager.) Tj T*
(The company provides a one-time home office allowance of 300 euros for employees approved) Tj T*
(for remote work. Equipment bought with the allowance remains the property of the employee.) Tj T*
(Remote workers must be reachable during core hours from 10:00 to 15:00 and must use the) Tj T*
(company VPN when accessing internal systems.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
