(Section 4. Travel and expenses) Tj T*
(Business travel must be booked through the approved travel agency. Economy class is) Tj T*
(required for flights shorter than 6 hours. Business class may be booked for longer flights) Tj T*
(with director approval.) Tj T*
(Expense claims must be submitted within 30 days of the expense being incurred, together) Tj T*
(with itemised receipts. Claims submitted later than 90 days are rejected.) Tj T*
(The following daily limits apply to reimbursed expenses:) Tj T*
(Expense type | Domestic limit | International limit) Tj T*
(Hotel per night | 140 euros | 210 euros) Tj T*
(Meals per day | 45 euros | 70 euros) Tj T*
(Local transport per day | 25 euros | 40 euros) Tj T*
(Mileage for use of a private car is reimbursed at 0.30 euros per kilometre. Parking and) Tj T*
(toll charges are reimbursed at cost with a receipt.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
